      "description": "The graph does not explicitly represent the toxic dispersion consequence from the released HF and chlorine, even though that was a major reported outcome of the rupture.",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "issue_type": "schema_mismatch",
      "description": "The BLEVE node evidence is not schema-compliant because it is not a short verbatim quote; it includes paraphrase and analytical text.",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "issue_type": "other",
      "description": "The graph simplifies the released process inventory by using only an HF material node, even though chlorine was also a significant released toxic material.",
